\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0   Lord, take good care of our children
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Draw them all unto your fold
\par Truly, all of them are sinners
\par But for Thee, they are redeemed
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And through  their baptism we
\par bring these children unto you
\par Jesus, kindly take care of them,
\par Let them walk on the path of truth.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  You have cared for them till this day
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Continue your care for them
\par Let them stay under your shadow
\par  And defend them from evil
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj When they encounter their foes
\par  When they stumble and falling
\par Stretch forth Thy hand to defend them
\par Keep them, defend them and save them.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   If ever the tempts tempts them
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Wanting them to fall in sin
\par Open their eyes so to behold
\par That through sin, they may be lost
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par If lust of the flesh sets in
\par And their passions disturb them
\par Let them be watchful and upright;
\par Let them come out victorious.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Lord, kindly let these our children
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Be children in your Kingdom!
\par Let them appreciate your love too
\par And let none of them get lost
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Let them surrender their hearts
\par All to thee, their good Saviour
\par And their deeds as well as their speech
\par Be just like what will befit Thee
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  One day when we have come to end
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Our life long journey on earth
\par Cause us all to meet together
\par And all draw near Thy Kingdom
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par But then, I will present them
\par And proclaim that: Oh my Lord
\par Thou has provided me children
\par \pard      Never to be lost before Thee. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

